<section class="app-page" data-page-panel="console"><div class="section-heading"><div><h2>RCON 控制台</h2><p>向当前连接的服务器发送远程管理指令。</p></div><div class="d-flex gap-2"><button class="btn btn-primary" data-action="broadcast"><i class="bi bi-megaphone me-2"></i>发送广播消息</button><button class="btn btn-surface" data-action="clear-console"><i class="bi bi-trash3 me-2"></i>清空日志</button></div></div><article class="console-panel"><div class="console-toolbar"><span><i class="bi bi-circle-fill text-success"></i> RCON 已连接</span><small>所有命令仅发送至当前选中的服务器</small></div><div id="console-output" class="console-output"><p class="console-muted">幻兽帕鲁服务器管理工具 · RCON 控制台准备就绪。</p></div><form id="console-form" class="console-input"><span>›</span><input id="console-command" autocomplete="off" placeholder="输入 RCON 指令……"><button type="submit">执行 <kbd>Enter</kbd></button></form></article><div class="command-chips"><span>常用指令</span><button data-fill-command="Info">服务器信息</button><button data-fill-command="ShowPlayers">显示玩家</button><button data-fill-command="Save">保存世界</button><button data-action="broadcast">发送广播</button></div></section>
